                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3e1e5958-767b-3c06-8220-e443727ad6b4",
                        "entry_id": "a654a94e-a561-3a5e-9be5-8c847fea357f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "roast beef"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "42968626-80d5-471e-b6a8-5658cc6ec6de",
                                "sense_id": "3e1e5958-767b-3c06-8220-e443727ad6b4",
                                "text": "Жена́ говори́т мне:\n— Не хо́чешь ли холо́дного ро́стбифа и стака́н воды́ с вино́м? а мы у Васи́льевых у́жинали.",
                                "translation": "My wife says to me:\n“Would you like some cold roast beef and a glass of water with wine? We had supper at the Vasilievs’.”",
                                "english": "My wife says to me:\n“Would you like some cold roast beef and a glass of water with wine? We had supper at the Vasilievs’.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8b55bc0f-06d6-4efc-9586-c7d9815b53c7",
                                "sense_id": "3e1e5958-767b-3c06-8220-e443727ad6b4",
                                "text": "Я зака́зывал в рестора́не кусо́к ро́стбифа и говори́л в телефо́н Елисе́еву, что́бы присла́ли нам икры́, сы́ру, у́стриц и проч.",
                                "translation": "I ordered a piece of roast beef from the restaurant and telephoned to Eliseyev's to send us caviare, cheese, oysters, and so on.",
                                "english": "I ordered a piece of roast beef from the restaurant and telephoned to Eliseyev's to send us caviare, cheese, oysters, and so on."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
